| **Nearest Public Transport** | <ul><li>**Metro**: Lines 51, 53, 54 – stop *Amsterdam Central* (≈5 min walk)</li><li>**Tram**: Lines 4, 14, 24 – stop *Oosterdok*</li><li>**Bus**: Various city lines stop nearby</li></ul> |
| **Website** | https://www.amsterdamdungeon.com |
